{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features and Functions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Ultra-realistic VHS video simulation for an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 A wide variety of collectible items covering all aspects of childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 3 complete, themed levels, with ongoing expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Support for the latest technologies, including Lumen, Nanite, and DLSS.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in this Chinese dreamcore exploration game, where you can momentarily escape the bustling present and drift into the hazy memories of the 2000s, collecting fragments of times gone by...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/12.png?t=1747208510\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Chinese Foyer:</strong> Under buzzing fluorescent lights and against yellowed wallpaper, childhood memories are scattered and reassembled in a surreal collage - familiar yet strange. While memories might tempt you to linger, remember: this is no longer home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/ScreenShot00020.png?t=1747208510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Deserted Campus:</strong> Weather-worn blackboards, the echo of school bells, and desk surfaces etched with countless marks transport you back to days filled with study and sweat. Wander through empty hallways, past familiar dormitories and well-worn running tracks, taking one final glimpse at the afterglow of youth. Ironically, the place you once couldn't wait to leave has become the place you most long to return to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/ScreenShot000191.png?t=1747208510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Old\u00a0 Bathhouse:</strong> Mosaic tiles reflect dim light through rising steam, while the air carries the nostalgic scent of soap and talcum powder, evoking memories of carefree summer days. Yet, while you can revisit the past, you'll find these spaces hauntingly empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/11111.png?t=1747208510\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore without boundaries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture memories through your lens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/12\u670823\u65e5_1__1_.gif?t=1747208510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rediscover childhood pastimes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/12\u670823\u65e5_1_.gif?t=1747208510\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470560?t=1747208510","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470560?t=1747208510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/45c7b7a7bd8028aefc83d94fd7a6ee576e9d5aad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747208510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/45c7b7a7bd8028aefc83d94fd7a6ee576e9d5aad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747208510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features and Functions</h2><p class=\"bb_pa